WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.971
Open the account setup link from your invitation. This example

00:00:03.971 --> 00:00:07.943
follows an invited agency Agent. In Your Profile, check your

00:00:07.943 --> 00:00:11.914
First Name and Last Name, then enter your Phone number.

00:00:11.914 --> 00:00:13.900
A profile photo is optional.

00:00:14.624 --> 00:00:17.735
Select your Date of Birth. Use the year and month

00:00:17.735 --> 00:00:20.224
menus in the calendar, then choose the day.

00:00:23.541 --> 00:00:28.159
Enter your National Producer Number in NPN. Check the required

00:00:28.159 --> 00:00:31.391
details, then select Continue to open Address.

00:00:32.458 --> 00:00:36.652
Enter Street and City. Choose your State and enter your

00:00:36.652 --> 00:00:40.008
ZIP Code. Here, the address is entered manually.

00:00:44.874 --> 00:00:49.549
Select Continue. Invited agency Agents move to Create Password. Individual

00:00:49.549 --> 00:00:54.224
accounts may show an extra Licensing step before this screen.

00:00:54.956 --> 00:00:58.775
Enter a password that meets the displayed requirements, then enter

00:00:58.775 --> 00:01:02.593
the same value in Repeat Password. Check that all requirements

00:01:02.593 --> 00:01:03.356
are satisfied.

00:01:05.873 --> 00:01:09.776
Select Finish to complete account setup. When the completion screen

00:01:09.776 --> 00:01:13.680
appears, select Go To Dashboard to open your account. Your

00:01:13.680 --> 00:01:17.583
dashboard is the starting point for your next tasks in

00:01:17.583 --> 00:01:17.973
PolicyDen.
